{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39929","headline":"忆长安行 · 徐夤","name":"忆长安行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧历关中忆废兴，僭奢须戒俭须凭。\n火光只是烧秦冢，贼眼何曾视灞陵。\n钟鼓煎催人自急，侯王更换恨难胜。\n不如坐钓清溪月，心共寒潭一片澄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39929.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39929","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}